+The assignee mark is an IDENTITY test against `$REFINERY_TARGET`, never
+`!= $STEP_SESSION`. "Somebody who is not me" is satisfied by every third party a
+work bead can end up on — an operator parking it on a crew seat, a witness
+re-routing it, a reviewer taking it — and none of those is this step's handoff.
+Read as evidence, they make a resuming polecat announce ALREADY_SUBMITTED and
+drain while the refinery never receives the work and the branch strands on
+origin unmerged (gcp-0pa4; observed live on winnow-zgr2y.8, parked on
+`winnow/specialists.thomas`). The blast radius scales with parked seats holding
+open beads, so the check has to name the one assignee that means "handed off"
+rather than enumerate the ones that do not.
+
 **3. Branch-shape gate (fails closed — non-negotiable).**
 
